  "primary_subject_agency_ids": [],
  "summary": "Harris County Precinct 5 Constables are investigating the vandalism of multiple Flock license-plate reader cameras in a Cypress, Texas neighborhood, with surveillance footage showing a person cutting them down with a power tool. Two cameras had solar panels stamped with 'release the Epstein files.' The cameras are owned by Harris County MUD 165.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "An investigation is underway after multiple license plate-reading Flock cameras were hacked down in Cypress.",
      "paragraph_idx": 2
    },
    {
      "quote": "The solar panels on two of the cameras were stamped with \"release the Epstein files.\"",
      "paragraph_idx": 12
    },
    {
      "quote": "Critics have expressed concerns about how the license plate data is being used, and multiple police officers have been investigated for abusing their Flock database privileges.",
